id: magic-blaster
name: Magic Blaster
talentCategory: magic-attack
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
description: >
  Choosing to focus solely on your magical skills, you eschew other forms of combat to fire spell after spell at the enemy.
text: >
  Magic Blaster: Choosing to focus solely on your magical skills, you eschew other forms of combat to fire spell after spell at the enemy.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Magic Attacks by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use an Attacking Maneuver of the Magic Foundation, you may apply an AoE of your choice to that Attacking Maneuver. If that Attacking Maneuver already possesses an AoE, you may instead increase the Magnitude of that AoE by 1 Category.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: After using a Magical Unique Ability or the Magic Trick Special Maneuver, you may use the Energy Charge Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. Your declared Attacking Maneuver must be a Magic Attack.

---

[passive]
# (1)
wound.magic += 1(T);
# (2) An Attacking Maneuver of the Magic Foundation declared: asked, once a Round - a Standard Sphere, Cone or Line where it has no AoE, or
# its Magnitude 1 higher where it has one (maneuvers.mjs askBoughtAreas, askMagicBlasterArea). That attack's alone: no button.
allow magicBlaster.area;
# (3) A Magical Unique Ability or the Magic Trick used: the Energy Charge offered on its card out of sequence - its Ki, no
# Action - for a Magic Attack only; once a Round (chat.mjs offerMagicCharge, takeMagicCharge; use-maneuver.mjs declareCharge).
allow magicBlaster.charge;
